# Presets deliberately not kept in this repo.
# One glob per line, matched against a preset's internal name.
# `tools/sync.py` skips these on export and lists them under "ignored" in status.

# This repo curates the 0.20mm and 0.16mm calibrated profiles. Other layer
# heights and one-off experiments stay in Creality Print, not backed up here.
